# S26: Launch

## Objective

Ship the platform publicly. Comprehensive public README: what app-agent-io is,
how to fork it, how to deploy it, how to add your own apps. Changelog from S01.
Security audit. Feature:health CI green. Demo deploy on public URL with seed data.
Press kit. The "tech company in a box" is ready to hand to someone who wants to
bootstrap their own AI-powered work platform.

## Launch checklist

### Documentation
- [ ] `README.md` at repo root: what / why / how to fork / how to deploy
- [ ] `CHANGELOG.md`: S01–S26 milestones
- [ ] `CONTRIBUTING.md`: how to add an app, how to add a knowledge slug
- [ ] `docs/content/` full company handbook reviewed and accurate

### Security
- [ ] Auth flows audited: no bypass paths
- [ ] Rate limiting on `/api/chats/*/messages` (prevent LLM abuse)
- [ ] Input validation on all user-facing routes
- [ ] No secrets in git history (`git secrets` scan)
- [ ] CORS headers correct on all apps

### Quality
- [ ] `bun run typecheck` exits 0
- [ ] `bun run test` 100% pass
- [ ] `bun run feature:health` all slugs green
- [ ] Lighthouse scores: Performance ≥80, Accessibility ≥90, PWA ≥90
- [ ] No console errors on any page

### Deployment
- [ ] Public demo URL live with seed data
- [ ] Custom domain (app-agent.io or subdomain)
- [ ] SSL cert, HSTS, CSP headers

## Tasks

- [ ] S26-T01-FreezeInvariants.pd
- [ ] S26-T02-PublicReadme.pd
- [ ] S26-T03-Changelog.pd
- [ ] S26-T04-SecurityAudit.pd
- [ ] S26-T05-RateLimiting.pd           — on messages + tasks/run endpoints
- [ ] S26-T06-LaunchChecklist.pd        — verify all items above
- [ ] S26-T07-DemoDeploySmoke.pd        — full smoke on public URL

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Public README covers fork-and-deploy in under 30 minutes
- [ ] Demo URL accessible to external visitors
- [ ] Security audit finds no critical/high issues
- [ ] All quality gates green
- [ ] **"Tech company in a box" is shippable**

## App-agent protocol

All tasks follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.

## After S26

The platform is live. Future sprints depend on user feedback:
- User feedback loop / telemetry (privacy-first)
- Plugin / extension system for third-party agents
- Advanced RBAC (roles per board, per org)
- White-label / multi-org SaaS
